    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1952242763539378502",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1952242763539378502",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1952242763539378502",
      "text": "[6:15AM]  #AgegeMotorRd\n#TrafficUpdate\nTrafficmoves slowly  along ile zik towards Aiayi farm, Ikeja along down to National this morning due to overnight heavy downpour within the Territory.\n\nNational to Airport turning, PWD, Shogunle, Ladipo is better but approaching Bolade intersection is a slow movement due to traffic light alternation at Bolade junction.\n\nThe return journey back to Ikeja from Bolade is perfectly good, likewise Ajayi farm connecting Mongoro, Cement down to Dopemu bridge for now.\n\nFlash flood along Ikeja axis also contributed to slow traffic movement within the axis.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
